  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingIssuedSharesAndTreasurySharesTextBlock contextRef="Prior1YearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;"&gt;１　発行済株式の種類及び総数並びに自己株式の種類及び株式数に関する事項&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:6pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:469pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:105.8pt;min-width:105.8pt;"/&gt;
